# Uvagf · 25 · Ybt yvarf sebz arkg lrne

## Uvag 1

Qb abg fcyvg gur yvar ba fcnprf. Gur sbezng vf cbfvgvbany: gur cevbevgl fgnegf ng olgr 0, gur
gvzrfgnzc vf rknpgyl 15 olgrf naq pbagnvaf fcnprf bs vgf bja, naq gur grkg znl ubyq nalguvat.
Nfx vafgrnq: "jurer nz V va gur yvar, naq jung zhfg pbzr arkg?" Xrrc 1 vaqrk vagb gur yvar, ernq
rnpu cneg sebz gung vaqrk, naq zbir gur vaqrk cnfg vg. Jura lbh ercbeg na reebe, gur pbyhza vf
gung vaqrk cyhf 1. Jevgr gur yvar sebz gur bcravat ba cncre jvgu gur pbyhza bs rirel cneg nobir
vg orsber lbh pbqr.

## Uvag 2

`gvzr.Cnefr(gvzr.Fgnzc, ...)` tvirf lbh n gvzr va lrne 0 naq HGP. Qb abg pbaireg vg jvgu `Va`:
gung zbirf gur jnyy pybpx ol gur mbar bssfrg. Gnxr vgf zbagu, qnl naq pybpx naq ohvyq n arj gvzr
jvgu `gvzr.Qngr` va `abj.Ybpngvba()`, svefg jvgu `abj.Lrne()`, gura pbzcner vg jvgu `abj` gb qrpvqr
jurgure lbh arrq gur lrne orsber. Sbe gur ubfg, gur genc vf gur yvar jvgubhg bar: gur arkg jbeq
gura raqf jvgu `:`, naq n cnefre gung gnxrf "gur arkg jbeq" nf gur ubfg unf thrffrq. Vs lbh hfr
`v == yra(yvar)` nf "gur raq" rireljurer, rirel reebe ng gur raq bs gur yvar trgf gur pbyhza
`yra(yvar)+1` sbe serr.

## Uvag 3

Na bhgyvar:

1. `Fgevat`: n gnoyr bs 8 anzrf vaqrkrq ol gur frirevgl, jvgu n enatr purpx svefg; bgurejvfr
   `Frirevgl(A)`. `Reebe` vf 1 `szg.Fcevags`, `Hajenc` ergheaf `Ree`.
2. N fznyy urycre gung ohvyqf gur reebe sebz n svryq, n 0-onfrq vaqrk naq n pnhfr ergheaf gur mreb
   `Zrffntr` naq `&CnefrReebe{..., Pby: vaqrk + 1, ...}`. Rirel reebe cngu pnyyf vg.
3. Cevbevgl: purpx gur `<`. Nqinapr bire ng zbfg 3 qvtvgf. Vs lbh nqinaprq bire abar, be gur arkg
   olgr vf zvffvat be vf abg `>`, snvy ng gur pheerag vaqrk. Pbaireg gur qvtvgf, purpx gur enatr
   (snvy ng vaqrk 1), fgrc bire gur `>`.
4. Gvzrfgnzc: vs srjre guna 15 olgrf ner yrsg, snvy ng `yra(yvar)`. Cnefr gur 15 olgrf; ba reebe
   jenc obgu reebef jvgu 2 `%j` ireof naq snvy ng gur fgneg. Vs n olgr sbyybjf naq vg vf abg n
   fcnpr, snvy gurer.
5. Ubfg: vs gur yvar raqf, snvy. Fxvc 1 fcnpr, svaq gur arkg fcnpr jvgu `fgevatf.VaqrkOlgr` (be
   gur raq). Na rzcgl jbeq be n jbeq raqvat va `:` vf n zvffvat ubfg ng gur fgneg bs gur jbeq.
6. Gnt: vs gur yvar raqf, snvy. Fxvc 1 fcnpr, nqinapr bire gur ncc anzr, snvy vs vg vf rzcgl. Vs n
   `[` sbyybjf, nqinapr bire qvtvgf naq qrznaq n `]`, gura pbaireg jvgu `fgepbai.Ngbv`. Qrznaq n
   `:`, gura fxvc 1 bcgvbany fcnpr. Gur erfg vf gur grkg.
7. Lrne: ohvyq gur gvzr jvgu `abj.Lrne()`; vs `g.Fho(abj)` vf zber guna 7 qnlf, ohvyq vg ntnva
   jvgu gur lrne orsber.
